  --------------------------------
    ENERGY PARTITIONING (ENPART)
  --------------------------------

  Wavefunction                            : KS-DFT, restricted
  Atomic definition                       : TFVC (real space)

  Each matrix below holds the one-center (self) terms on the diagonal and
  the whole A-B pair term off it; its total adds the diagonal and one
  triangle. Energies in au.
  VERBOSE 1 in # METHOD also prints the intermediate matrices.

  ----------------------
    DENSITY FUNCTIONAL
  ----------------------

  libxc functional                        : BHandHLYP a.k.a. BHLYP: 50% B88 exchange and 50% HF exchange with 100% LYP correlation (libxc id 436)
  Kind                                    : exchange-correlation
  Family                                  : hybrid GGA
  Exact-exchange fraction                 :          0.500
  Reference [1]                           : A. D. Becke,  J. Chem. Phys. 98, 1372 (1993)
  Reference [2]                           : Defined through Gaussian implementation.

